<section class="generic-content-block ">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 col-lg-6 display-size-11">
                
<h4>Bringing Our Innovative Model to Equities</h4>
<p>We&rsquo;ve brought everything we&rsquo;ve learned as an electronic fixed income pioneer and innovator to equity trading, improving efficiency and access to liquidity with our multi-dealer RFQ protocol.</p>
<p>Today, we operate a global RFQ platform for equities, delivering a full trade life cycle workflow solution for <a href="/our-markets/institutional/equities/etps_funds/">ETFs</a>, <a href="/our-markets/institutional/equities/equity-derivatives/">derivatives</a>, <a href="/our-markets/institutional/equities/equity-derivatives/">options</a> and ADRs. Clients can get better pricing by putting multiple liquidity providers in competition, streamline their workflow and help demonstrate best execution. Our <a href="/our-markets/institutional/trade-cycle/automated-trading/">Automated Intelligent Execution (AiEX) technology</a> is used across products to automate workflows and help traders focus on more strategic rules-based use cases, as routine tasks are taken care of.&nbsp;</p>
            </div>
                <figure class="col-12 col-lg-6 figure pt-sm-5 pt-lg-0 pl-lg-5 text-center">
                    <!-- TODO: Done CHeck COntext.request.host below-->
                        <a href="/newsroom/media-center/insights/blog/how-etfs-defined-a-decade-and-set-the-stage-for-the-future-of-financial-markets-innovation/" target="_self">

    <img data-src="/493448/globalassets/newsroom/blogs/2026/3.5-adam-etf-anniversary/blog---u.s.-etf-anniversary---web-promos_factoid.jpg"
          class="img-fluid"                    alt="ETF blog promo"           />
                        </a>
                </figure>
        </div>
    </div>
</section></div><div>
    <div class="key-features-block bg-color-light-grey">
        <div class="content container">
                <h4 class="title deep-blue font-slatepro-light">Key Features</h4>
            <div class="content-wrapper">
                <div class="key-features-content">
                        
<ul>
<li>Access to the global ETF markets</li>
<li>Ability to trade options, futures and hybrids including convertible bonds and preferred stock</li>
<li>Growing offering for American Depositary Receipts (ADRs)</li>
<li>European cash equities&nbsp;available to trade</li>
<li>Full local market support from our expert teams</li>
</ul>
                </div>
